message: "If you use this repository, please cite it as below."
title: "Agents Towards Production: An Open-Source Playbook for Production-Grade GenAI Agents"
version: "1.0.0"
date-released: "2025-06-16"
authors:
  - family-names: "Diamant"
    given-names: "Nir"
repository-code: "https://github.com/NirDiamant/agents-towards-production"
url: "https://github.com/NirDiamant/agents-towards-production"
abstract: >-
  An open-source playbook of end-to-end, code-first tutorials for turning
  GenAI agents into real-world products. Independent tutorial tracks cover
  orchestration, memory, retrieval, security and guardrails, observability
  and tracing, evaluation, containerized deployment, GPU serving,
  fine-tuning and user interfaces.
keywords:
  - ai-agents
  - production
  - mlops
  - deployment
  - observability
  - guardrails
  - llm
  - agentic-ai
  - tutorials
